WEBVTT

00:00.421 --> 00:02.170
Kwenye video hii, nitaeleza kidogo

00:02.170 --> 00:06.264
kuhusu ni nini maana ya namba tasa.

00:06.264 --> 00:07.680
Katika video hii

00:07.680 --> 00:09.650
au kitu utakachoona kwenye video hii,

00:09.650 --> 00:11.840
ni dhana rahisi inayoweza kueleweka.

00:11.840 --> 00:14.097
Lakini kadiri unavyoendelea kujifunza hesabati

00:14.097 --> 00:16.680
utaweza kuona dhana ngumu

00:16.680 --> 00:20.030
zinazoendana na namba tasa.

00:20.030 --> 00:22.277
Mojawapo ni dhana ya mafumbo ya namba

00:22.277 --> 00:24.610
Na pengine baadhi ya alama za mficho wa taarifa ambazo kompyuta yako inatua

00:24.610 --> 00:26.879
kwasasa yawezekana zinatokana elimu ya namba tasa.

00:26.879 --> 00:28.545
Kama hujui maana ya hii dhana ya mficho wa taarifa

00:28.545 --> 00:30.450
huna haja ya kusumbuka.

00:30.450 --> 00:34.410
Unachohitaji kujua ni kwamba namba tasa ni muhimu.

00:34.410 --> 00:36.092
Nitakupa tafsiri yake

00:36.092 --> 00:38.050
Na pengine hii tafsri inaweza kukuchanganya kidogo,

00:38.050 --> 00:39.600
lakini tukitumia mifano,

00:39.600 --> 00:42.680
itasaidia kuifanya iwe rahisi kuielewa.

00:42.680 --> 00:48.790
Kwahiyo namba ni tasa ikiwa ni namba nzima

00:48.790 --> 00:51.740
na namba kamili, tunarudia, kwa mfano,

00:51.740 --> 00:55.130
ni namba kama vile 1, 2, 3 kwahiyo ni namba

00:55.130 --> 00:57.020
zinazohesabika kuanzia 1 au unaweza

00:57.020 --> 00:58.450
kusema ni namba chanya.

00:58.450 --> 01:11.740
Ni namba kamili inayogawanyika moja kwa moja kwa namba mbili

01:11.740 --> 01:13.240
au namba chanya nyingine mbili.

01:13.240 --> 01:14.698
Nisiseme mbili nyingine,

01:14.698 --> 01:17.630
Niseme namba chanya nyingine mbili

01:17.630 --> 01:19.870
Kwahiyo sio namba chanya nyingine mbili

01:19.870 --> 01:24.190
zinagawanyika moja kwa moja kwa namba chanya mbili.

01:24.190 --> 01:31.130
Moja kati ya hizo namba ni yenyewe na nyingine ni moja.

01:31.130 --> 01:33.380
Hizo ni namba mbili ambazo zinagawanyika.

01:33.380 --> 01:34.740
Na ndio maana sikutaka kusema moja kwa moja

01:34.740 --> 01:37.120
namba mbili chanya, kwa sababu moja kati ya hizi namba

01:37.120 --> 01:38.866
ni yenyewe.

01:38.866 --> 01:40.490
Na hii haileti maana kwako,

01:40.490 --> 01:42.030
tufanye mifano kidogo hapa,

01:42.030 --> 01:44.640
na tufanye tuone kama baadhi ya namba ni tasa au hapana.

01:44.640 --> 01:49.200
Hebu tuanze na namba nzima ndogo kabisa-- namba 1.

01:49.200 --> 01:52.430
Unaweza kusema, inagawanyika kwa 1

01:52.430 --> 01:54.220
na inagawanyika kwa yenyewe.

01:54.220 --> 01:56.860
Unaweza kusema, 1, ni namba tasa.

01:56.860 --> 01:58.550
Lakini kumbuka, sehemu ya tafsiri yetu--

01:58.550 --> 02:02.620
inatueleza kwamba lazima igawanyike kwa namba nzima mbili.

02:02.620 --> 02:06.640
1 inagawanyika kwa namba nzima moja-- kwa 1 pekee.

02:06.640 --> 02:09.259
Kwahiyo 1, ingawa inaonekana kuwa ndogo

02:09.259 --> 02:15.590
sio tasa.

02:15.590 --> 02:16.680
Twende kwenye 2.

02:19.490 --> 02:25.890
Kwahiyo 2 inagawanyika kwa 1 na kwa 2 lakini

02:25.890 --> 02:27.940
sio kwa namba nzima nyingine.

02:27.940 --> 02:30.150
Inaonekana kukutana na kikwazo chetu.

02:30.150 --> 02:33.950
Inagawanyika moja kwa moja kwa namba nzima mbili--yenyewe

02:33.950 --> 02:36.240
nayo ni 2 upande huu, na 1.

02:36.240 --> 02:37.685
Kwahiyo 2 ni tasa.

02:40.610 --> 02:42.580
Nitaziweka ndani ya duara namba tasa.

02:42.580 --> 02:43.289
Nitazungushia duara.

02:43.289 --> 02:45.329
Ngoja nifanye kwatumia rangi nyingine,

02:45.329 --> 02:47.320
kwakua tayari nimeshatumia hii rangi--

02:47.320 --> 02:48.220
nitazizungushia duara.

02:48.220 --> 02:51.500
Nitazizungushia duara namba ambazo ni tasa

02:51.500 --> 02:53.630
Na 2 inavutia hapa kwa sababu

02:53.630 --> 02:56.180
ni namba shufwa pekee ambayo ni tasa

02:56.180 --> 02:58.060
Kama unafikiria kuhusu hiyo, namba shufwa nyingine yoyote

02:58.060 --> 03:00.480
itagawanyika kwa 2, kubwa

03:00.480 --> 03:01.860
na ndogo ya 1 na yenyewe.

03:01.860 --> 03:03.030
Haitakua tasa.

03:03.030 --> 03:05.470
Tutaishughulikia hiyo kwenye videozijazo.

03:05.470 --> 03:07.480
Tujaribu 3.

03:07.480 --> 03:10.582
Sawa, 3 inagawanyika kwa 1 na 3.

03:10.582 --> 03:12.790
Na haigawanyika kwa namba nyingine katikati

03:12.790 --> 03:19.000
Haigawanyiki kwa 2, kwahiyo 3 pia ni namba tasa.

03:19.000 --> 03:20.700
Tujaribu 4.

03:20.700 --> 03:22.860
Nitatumia rangi nyingine hapa.

03:22.860 --> 03:24.080
Tujaribu 4.

03:24.080 --> 03:27.960
Sawa, 4 inagawanyika kwa 1 na 4.

03:27.960 --> 03:30.030
Lakini pia inagawanyika kwa 2.

03:30.030 --> 03:31.200
2 mara 2 ni 4.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.490
Nayo inagawanyik kwa 2.

03:33.490 --> 03:38.730
Kwahiyo inagawanyika kwa namba nzima tatu-- 1, 2, na 4.

03:38.730 --> 03:42.680
Kwahiyo haikutani na kikwazo chetu kwakua ni tasa.

03:42.680 --> 03:46.720
Tujaribu 5.

03:46.720 --> 03:49.270
Kwahiyo 5 inagawanyika kwa 1.

03:49.270 --> 03:50.740
Haigawanyiki kwa 2.

03:50.740 --> 03:51.900
Haigawanyiki kwa 3.

03:51.900 --> 03:56.149
Haigawanyiki moja kwa moja kwa 4.

03:56.149 --> 03:58.690
Unaweza kuzigawa kwa hiyo namba, lakini utabakiwa na namba.

03:58.690 --> 04:01.860
Lakini inagawika moja kwa moja kwa 5,

04:01.860 --> 04:06.350
Hapa tena, inagawanyika moja kwa moja kwa namba nzima mbili--

04:06.350 --> 04:08.280
1 na 5.

04:08.280 --> 04:11.586
Tena, 5 ni tasa.

04:11.586 --> 04:12.960
Tuendelee, ili tuweze

04:12.960 --> 04:15.340
kuona kama kuna kanuni yoyote hapa.

04:15.340 --> 04:17.390
Na pengine nitajitahidi

04:17.390 --> 04:19.130
kutumia njia ambayo inawababaisha wengi.

04:19.130 --> 04:23.350
Tuchague namba.

04:23.350 --> 04:24.300
6

04:24.300 --> 04:26.470
Inagawanyika kwa 1.

04:26.470 --> 04:28.940
Inagawanyika kwa 2.

04:28.940 --> 04:30.270
Inagawanyika kwa 3.

04:30.270 --> 04:33.190
Sio kwa 4 au 5, lakini inagawanyika kwa 6.

04:33.190 --> 04:36.290
Kwahiyo ina vigawo vya namba nzima nne.

04:36.290 --> 04:38.010
Nadhani ungeweza kusema kama hivyo.

04:38.010 --> 04:39.940
Na hivyo haina namba mbili inazogawanyika nazo

04:39.940 --> 04:41.450
moja kwa kwa moja.

04:41.450 --> 04:44.610
Ina nne, kwahiyo ni tasa.

04:44.610 --> 04:47.480
Tutumie 7.

04:47.480 --> 04:54.330
7 inagawanyika kwa 1, sio 2, sio 3, sio 4, sio 5, sio 6.

04:54.330 --> 04:56.160
Lakini pia inagawanyika kwa 7.

04:56.160 --> 04:59.020
Kwahiyo 7 ni tasa.

04:59.020 --> 05:00.640
Nadhani unaelewa dhana hii.

05:00.640 --> 05:03.560
Namba nzima ngapi---namba

05:03.560 --> 05:07.090
kama 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, namba ulizojifunza kipindi

05:07.090 --> 05:10.490
ukiwa na umri wa miaka miwili, zisizokua 0 wala namba hasi

05:10.490 --> 05:13.340
wala sehemu na zile zisizowiana na desimali

05:13.340 --> 05:17.250
na zote zilizosalia, isipokua namba chanya za kawaida.

05:17.250 --> 05:19.270
Kama una namba mbili pekee, kama zinagawanyika kwa

05:19.270 --> 05:23.140
zenyewe na kwa moja, basi hizo ni tasa.

05:23.140 --> 05:24.640
Na jinsi ninavyozitazama--kama

05:24.640 --> 05:26.540
tukiachana na suala maalum la namba 1,

05:26.540 --> 05:30.440
namba tasa ni mfano wa namba kama hizi.

05:30.440 --> 05:31.899
Huwezi kuzivunjavunjazaidi

05:31.899 --> 05:34.190
ni kama mfano wa atomu-- unavyofikiria kuhusu

05:34.190 --> 05:35.606
atomu ni nini, au mwanzoni watu walivyokua wakifikiria

05:35.606 --> 05:36.990
wakifikiria kuhusu atomu--

05:36.990 --> 05:38.860
walidhani kua ni kitu kidogo kisichoweza kugawanyika

05:38.860 --> 05:39.190
zaidi.

05:39.190 --> 05:40.850
Sasa tunajua kwamba unaweza kuigawanya atomu

05:40.850 --> 05:42.308
na kama unaweza kufanya hivyo, unaweza

05:42.308 --> 05:43.540
kuunda mlipuko wa kinyuklia.

05:43.540 --> 05:46.790
Lakini ni dhana ile ile kuhusu namba tasa.

05:46.790 --> 05:49.750
Katika uhalisia wa namba tasa, sio dhahania,

05:49.750 --> 05:51.380
tunajua kwamba huwezikuzivunjavunja

05:51.380 --> 05:56.370
kua katika zao la namba nzima ndogo ndogo

05:56.370 --> 06:00.320
Kama 6-- unaweza kusema, 6 ni 2 mara 3.

06:00.320 --> 06:01.280
Unaweza kuivunjaavunja.

06:01.280 --> 06:05.290
Na zingatia kwamba, unaweza kuivunjavunja kama zao la namba tasa.

06:05.290 --> 06:07.740
Tumejaribu kuivunjavunja kwenye sehemu zake.

06:07.740 --> 06:09.930
7, huwezi kuivunjavunja zaidi.

06:09.930 --> 06:13.346
Unachoweza kusema ni kwamba 7 ni sawa na 1 mara 7,

06:13.346 --> 06:15.720
na kwa hali hiyo, hujaivunjavunja zaidi.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.690
Bado hapo unayo 7 tena.

06:17.690 --> 06:19.440
6 unaweza kuivunjavunja.

06:19.440 --> 06:22.302
4 unaweza kuivunjavunja kama 2 mara 2.

06:22.302 --> 06:24.760
Sasa tukiachana na hiyo, tufikirie kuhusu namba kubwa

06:24.760 --> 06:28.910
fikiria kuhusu kama hizo namba kubwa ni tasa.

06:28.910 --> 06:33.870
Tufikirie 16.

06:33.870 --> 06:37.750
Ni wazi kua, namba yoyote tasainagawanyika kwa 1 na yenyewe.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.700
Namba nzima yoyote unayoiweka hapa

06:39.700 --> 06:41.242
itagawanyika kwa kwa 1 na 16.

06:41.242 --> 06:42.866
Kwahiyo daima utaanza na 2.

06:42.866 --> 06:45.150
Kwahiyo unaweza kutafuta namba nyingine inayoingia kwenye hii

06:45.150 --> 06:47.060
kisha unajua sio tasa

06:47.060 --> 06:52.620
Na kwa 16, unaweza kua na 2 mara 8, pia 4 mara 4.

06:52.620 --> 06:54.620
Kwahiyo ina vigawo vingi hapa

06:54.620 --> 06:56.720
zaidi ya 1 na 16.

06:56.720 --> 06:59.410
Kwahiyo 16 sio tasa.

06:59.410 --> 07:02.340
Vipi kuhusu 17?

07:02.340 --> 07:05.500
1 na 17 zitaingia kwenye.

07:05.500 --> 07:06.700
2 haiingii kwenye 17.

07:06.700 --> 07:07.530
3 hiingii.

07:07.530 --> 07:10.650
4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11-- namba yoyote kati hizi

07:10.650 --> 07:15.360
hakuna namba yoyote kati ya 1 na 17 inayongia kwenye 17.

07:15.360 --> 07:20.130
Kwahiyo 17 ni tasa.

07:20.130 --> 07:22.920
Sasa nitakupa namba ngumu.

07:22.920 --> 07:25.350
Hii inaweza kuwachanganya wengi.

07:25.350 --> 07:27.610
Vipi kuhusu 51?

07:27.610 --> 07:29.555
Je 51 ni tasa?

07:33.022 --> 07:34.480
Kama unapenda,

07:34.480 --> 07:36.390
unaweza kusimamisha kwa muda video

07:36.390 --> 07:40.060
na kujaribu kufanya mwenyewe kama 51 ni namba tasa.

07:40.060 --> 07:44.520
Kama unaweza kupata namba nyingine zaidi ya 1 au 51

07:44.520 --> 07:46.740
ambayo inagawanyika kwa 51.

07:46.740 --> 07:49.130
Inaonekana kama namba hii ni ya pekee

07:49.130 --> 07:51.430
Unaweza kushawishika kusema ni tasa.

07:51.430 --> 07:54.720
Lakini sasa nitakupa jibu--sio tasa,

07:54.720 --> 07:59.030
kwasababu pia inagawanyika kwa 3 na 17.

07:59.030 --> 08:02.420
3 mara 17 ni 51

08:02.420 --> 08:04.045
Bila shaka hii inakupa dhana ya wazi

08:04.045 --> 08:05.590
kuhusu nini hasa namba tasa.

08:05.590 --> 08:08.260
Na natumai tunaweza kukupa mazoezi

08:08.260 --> 08:11.738
kwa video zinzaofuata au baadha yamazoezi yetu.
